   This line checks if the packet length plus one is greater than the size divided by four. If true, the function returns, preventing further processing.

3. **Parsing Report Blocks**:
   ```c
   while ((pj_int32_t*)rb_hdr < (pj_int32_t*)pkt + pkt_len)
